Loid	interacts with	But I - Yes. I see. Until we meet again, Tenno.
Loid	interacts with	Oh, it can be. Tenno, Master Entrati's Grimoire suggests you are the key. That colorless antique there - use it.
Loid	interacts with	Ugh, an... incomplete experiment, one might say.
Loid	interacts with	Tenno, while Loid completes his inspections, you'd better meet the Cavia... a reminder of darker times. Though Master Entrati always hoped the awaited Operator would be able to understand them?
Loid	interacts with	This is a Tenno. An orphan of the Void, continuing the struggle our Master abandoned.
Loid	interacts with	"Resume your duties, construct."
Loid	interacts with	This is, well, Loid. The original. All emotional centers very much intact. Did you have a good sleep?
Loid	interacts with	A trap? Master Entrati jealously protected his most adored possessions - be they objects... or people. Come. The Sleeper awaits.
Loid	interacts with	Right. Onward.
Loid	interacts with	If these fragments were to unite... Destroy them swiftly, Tenno!
Loid	interacts with	I ask too much of you, Tenno. These horrors must be stopped!
Loid	interacts with	A monstrous danger, these labs. Better off sealed. We can only hope The Sleeper has been untouched by this vast horror. This great Indifference.
Loid	interacts with	I confess it galls me slightly to see a compendium of knowledge used as a weapon, but needs must. We need be in no doubt of your skill, at any rate.
Loid	interacts with	The grimoire is very... active. It is... reading ... you!
Loid	interacts with	There! That book was like a diary to Master Entrati, his grimoire! No doubt it holds the secrets of the Vessels, and of the Kalymos Sequence! Take it, Tenno!
Loid	interacts with	Master Entrati called it the Voidtongue. He feared it was meaningless... and feared more that it was not.
Loid	interacts with	Necramechs. Poor, abandoned things. Still faithfully following Master Entrati's last command, to defend. Show mercy, Tenno. End them.
Loid	interacts with	Do you hear that? Let us hope The Sleeper is untroubled by such... strangeness. Find them.
Loid	interacts with	I fear we are off the edge of the map, and into the domain of monsters. Master Entrati never completed his final project: the VESSELS. The Sequence dictates they cannot awaken before the Sleeper does.
Loid	interacts with	I have one responsibility in the Kalymos Sequence: Awaken the Sleeper. But I cannot do it alone. Please, assist me once more?
Loid	interacts with	I must fulfill this dormant precept. The Kalymos Sequence has begun, and it cannot be undone.
Loid	interacts with	The memories surface, long locked away. This was no dream, Tenno. It was a precept. The Kalymos Sequence.
Loid	interacts with	(GASP)
Loid	interacts with	In my dream, one single name repeats. KALYMOS
Loid	interacts with	You must understand: constructs CANNOT dream. And yet, I have.
